Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.89,0:00:23.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The last time I saw Sengoku Nadeko was more than six years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.36,0:00:32.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So when we met again, I couldn't recognize her at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.26,0:00:51.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Had I noticed it was her a lot sooner,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.63,0:00:55.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,perhaps this story wouldn't have concluded in such a terrible manner.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.53,0:01:12.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But that regret
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.53,0:01:15.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,certainly has no meaning for the spirit either.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.23,0:03:06.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Was that girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.27,0:03:10.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't think I'd find a person this deep in the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.19,0:03:14.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And she was pretty damn cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.78,0:03:17.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's just keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.78,0:03:21.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Also, watch your feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.49,0:03:25.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bug bites are unavoidable, but a lot of snakes come out in this mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.54,0:03:26.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.17,0:03:37.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By the way, Araragi-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.17,0:03:40.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I forgot to ask you yesterday, but what are we doing on this mountain?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.47,0:03:42.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A job.\NFrom Oshino.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.23,0:03:50.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Apparently, there's an abandoned shrine at the top of the mountain,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.98,0:03:55.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and he wants us to place a seal there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.65,0:04:00.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Couldn't Oshino-san have done that himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.74,0:04:02.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He doesn't look very busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.91,0:04:05.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well... it's work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.12,0:04:13.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I owe him a ridiculous amount of debt from when he took care of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.84,0:04:16.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You do, too, Kanbaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.59,0:04:20.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He {\i1}is{\i0\fscx140} {\r}still a professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.97,0:04:24.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's not nice enough to lend us a hand for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.18,0:04:27.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, so that's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.65,0:04:33.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By the way, Araragi-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.61,0:04:37.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did Senjougahara-senpai say anything about today?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.19,0:04:40.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not in particular, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.20,0:04:43.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kanbaru, did she say something to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.20,0:04:48.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She told me to be spoiled as much as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.67,0:04:53.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She also told me...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.05,0:05:00.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"If Araragi-kun violates you, report to me immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.26,0:05:05.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whether it's to be buried in the mountains or drowned in the sea, I'll let him choose the one he doesn't like."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.97,0:05:09.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Choose the one I {\i1}don't{\i0\fscx150} {\r}like?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.31,0:05:16.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, Kanbaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.57,0:05:20.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just remembered about Senjougahara.\NIt's her birthday soon, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.90,0:05:22.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.\NJuly 7th.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.32,0:05:26.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So I was thinking about celebrating her birthday,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.53,0:05:29.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and I want to make my first time celebrating it really spectacular,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.87,0:05:34.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,inviting all her friends for a nice birthday party, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.63,0:05:37.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.63,0:05:40.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think Senjougahara-senpai will want to spend the day alone with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.13,0:05:43.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't think she's that type of a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.94,0:05:57.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kanbaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.52,0:05:59.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, Araragi-senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.69,0:06:02.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your... left hand.\NHow's it doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.99,0:06:09.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,According to Oshino-san, it'll be better before I turn twenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.70,0:06:11.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's great to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.20,0:06:14.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll be able to play basketball again once you're twenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.88,0:06:17.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.04,0:06:58.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Kanbaru?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.09,0:07:00.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm a little tired...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.30,0:07:02.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tired?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.63,0:07:05.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then do you want to rest somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.30,0:07:07.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where can we sit...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.26,0:07:10.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Actually, Araragi-senpai, how about we have lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.06,0:07:11.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.35,0:07:14.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.35,0:07:17.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When I'm sick, I usually feel better after filling up my stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.61,0:07:23.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.61,0:07:27.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then Kanbaru, could you look for an open spot where we can eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.11,0:07:31.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll go place this seal in the meantime.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.91,0:07:35.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.91,0:07:37.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry, but I'll have to ask you to finish the job, Araragi-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.79,0:07:38.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay. {\ja}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.05,0:07:52.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It feels like I've seen her somewhere before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.68,0:07:55.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.68,0:08:00.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hardly get the chance to meet girls in junior high unless it's through my sisters...{\lit: my sisters would but not me}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.86,0:08:02.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sisters?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.40,0:08:05.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, is this the main shrine?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.96,0:08:21.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There, all done.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.34,0:08:23.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kanbaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.51,0:08:26.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kanbaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.22,0:08:34.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kanbaru?!\NKanbaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.32,0:08:49.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kanbaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.11,0:08:54.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you, Araragi-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.62,0:08:57.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, what do you mean, "Oh, it's you?"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.58,0:08:59.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.62,0:09:01.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My heart just jumped.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.71,0:09:04.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't look good.\NAre you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.21,0:09:08.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you're feeling really sick,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.21,0:09:11.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}I think you can lay down at the porch of the shrine after I move some stuff around.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.51,0:09:15.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.\NAraragi-senpai.\NThat's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.93,0:09:19.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look... at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.46,0:09:44.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Was her name...\NSengoku Nadeko?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.06,0:10:03.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This, and I think this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.32,0:10:10.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, that book might not help you much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.86,0:10:16.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you want to go to a public college, I think this book's more helpful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.42,0:10:28.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.42,0:10:33.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}I'm a little surprised that you asked me to find you some reference books for college.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.72,0:10:37.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah...\NI thought I'd start thinking about my future.{\s0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.43,0:10:39.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your future?{\or w/e the TS tl is}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.39,0:10:44.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senjougahara and I were talking about it sometime ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.98,0:10:47.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and I asked her about what school she was applying for, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.11,0:10:53.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}If I remember correctly, Senjougahara-san's been invited to attend the public college in town, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.24,0:10:55.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You sure know everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.20,0:10:59.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not that I know everything. I just know what I know. {\MUST STAY LIKE THIS RAWR}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.08,0:11:01.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So Araragi-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.16,0:11:06.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you saying you're applying for the same school as Senjougahara-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.29,0:11:09.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't tell her about this.\NI don't want to give her any false hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.76,0:11:15.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By the way, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.43,0:11:17.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what do you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.18,0:11:23.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}You know how you told me at school that you went to an abandoned shrine yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.73,0:11:26.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have a question about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.73,0:11:33.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What did you do after you found a snake in five parts?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.78,0:11:35.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.15,0:11:40.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing, really.\NKanbaru and I dug a grave for the snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.58,0:11:48.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But when we looked around after that, we found a mountain of dead snakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.71,0:11:51.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A mountain?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.84,0:11:54.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. A mountain of chopped up snakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.88,0:11:58.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then we immediately descended the mountain,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.88,0:12:01.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and had lunch that Kanbaru packed{\or lit "made/packed/cooked} at a nearby park.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.80,0:12:02.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.26,0:12:06.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And I was really amazed at how good it tasted.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.64,0:12:09.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Apparently, her grandma helped her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.40,0:12:13.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, sounds like you had a tough time, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.19,0:12:16.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.19,0:12:20.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}It felt like some ritual to see snakes being killed in that way, so it made me think.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.78,0:12:23.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Especially since it was near that rundown shrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.78,0:12:28.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, Hanekawa.{\"Now that I mention it"}\NDid you already know there was a shrine there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.50,0:12:30.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. The Kitashira Snake Shrine, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.88,0:12:34.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Snake, huh?\NI guess...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.50,0:12:37.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Perhaps they worshiped snakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.76,0:12:40.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know much about it either, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.55,0:12:45.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Butchered snakes at a shrine that worshiped them...\NSounds like a ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.76,0:12:50.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess I should tell Oshino...\Nabout this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.69,0:12:57.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Araragi-kun, when I said you had a tough time, I was talking about you and Kanbaru-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.11,0:13:03.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A{\alpha&HFF&\t(523,523,\alpha&H00&)}bout {\alpha&HFF&\t(1023,1023,\alpha&H00&)}you {\alpha&HFF&\t(1524,1524,\alpha&H00&)}and {\alpha&HFF&\t(2024,2024,\alpha&H00&)}Ka{\alpha&HFF&\t(2525,2525,\alpha&H00&)}n{\alpha&HFF&\t(3025,3025,\alpha&H00&)}ba{\alpha&HFF&\t(3526,3526,\alpha&H00&)}ru{\alpha&HFF&\t(4026,4026,\alpha&H00&)}-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.66,0:13:06.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's what I was referring to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.05,0:13:18.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,About Kanbaru?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.55,0:13:22.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.55,0:13:26.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She suddenly fell ill, so I got kind of scared,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.09,0:13:26.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I'm glad it turned out to be nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.81,0:13:28.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.10,0:13:32.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't it a problem to get too close with your girlfriend's junior?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.77,0:13:37.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}It's not a problem to be a little friendly, but I don't think linking arms is acceptable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.48,0:13:40.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't look at me.\NShe's a generally clingy person.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.95,0:13:43.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You think that's an acceptable excuse?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.49,0:13:44.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.87,0:13:49.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...\NI already received a warning from Senjougahara.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.66,0:13:54.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will not tolerate any rudeness towards my junior.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.21,0:13:54.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.79,0:13:59.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And she apparently told Kanbaru to ask me to take care of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.76,0:14:00.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.38,0:14:03.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Would this be what she means?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.68,0:14:08.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.15,0:14:24.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.61,0:14:27.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you need another second, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.74,0:14:30.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.49,0:14:33.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun, you're weak and pale.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.13,0:14:38.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know how you're kind to just about anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.13,0:14:43.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think from Senjougahara-san's point of view, that isn't very reassuring.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.05,0:14:44.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't reassuring?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.34,0:14:51.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}I don't think Senjougahara-san actually wants you to be very close with Kanbaru-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.43,0:14:54.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.73,0:14:58.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can be close, or rather she wants you two to be close,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.61,0:15:00.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but she wants you to be firm about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.23,0:15:07.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think she wants you to choose her in comparison to Kanbaru-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.91,0:15:10.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the hell...\NI don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.74,0:15:13.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's probably Senjougahara-san's dilemma.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.70,0:15:17.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}You're her valuable boyfriend, and Kanbaru-san's an important junior to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.00,0:15:22.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well... since Senjougahara-san's a tsundere,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.80,0:15:27.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't think it's right to take her actions for what they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.80,0:15:29.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have to read deep into them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.06,0:15:34.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You too, Araragi-kun.\NIf you truly find Senjougahara-san important,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.48,0:15:37.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't think you should sway from an insignificant temptation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.77,0:15:41.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's irresponsible to be nice to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.15,0:15:44.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know now, thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.11,0:15:50.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By the way, where are you applying, Hanekawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.99,0:15:54.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tokyo University?\NOr are you going to study abroad?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.87,0:15:57.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh?\NI'm not going to college.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.83,0:16:01.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, you're not?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.92,0:16:04.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nope.\NI'm going on a journey once I graduate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.34,0:16:06.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A journey?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.34,0:16:10.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd spend two years or so seeing the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.10,0:16:14.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Since I seem to be too focused on pursuing knowledge,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.72,0:16:17.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I figured I should gain a lot of other experiences.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.39,0:16:21.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Keep this a secret from the teachers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.02,0:16:24.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They'd probably jump if they found out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.15,0:16:28.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I doubt that's all they'd do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.49,0:16:29.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ouch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.82,0:16:30.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.41,0:16:33.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, just a little headache.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.49,0:16:34.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A headache?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.41,0:16:36.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.66,0:16:40.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It recently started to happen from time to time.\NIt starts hurting without a warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.42,0:16:43.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, that doesn't sound like nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.46,0:16:45.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to walk you home?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.46,0:16:47.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No thanks.\NMy home's...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.09,0:16:50.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah...\NSorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.18,0:16:53.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's okay.\NBut... I'm sorry.\NI'll be going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.76,0:16:54.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, sure. See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.10,0:16:55.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.19,0:17:05.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sengoku?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.95,0:17:18.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This book's...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.17,0:17:28.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kanbaru?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.26,0:17:30.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to ask you for a little help.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.85,0:17:42.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So what did you need me for?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.02,0:17:47.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Do you remember the girl we met when we were going up these stairs yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.78,0:17:50.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.\NShe was a cute small girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.20,0:17:56.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}I thought I had seen her somewhere, and it hit me when I just saw her at the bookstore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.95,0:17:58.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's my younger sister's old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.08,0:17:59.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.25,0:18:02.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And is that girl here again?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.29,0:18:05.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right.\NI think.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.75,0:18:08.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And I asked for your help because...\NWell...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.71,0:18:11.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,though she's an old friend, I don't know how to approach her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.88,0:18:16.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}She probably doesn't remember me, so it could look like I'm flirting with her,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.01,0:18:21.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and a girl who just started puberty can have pretty scary reactions.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.52,0:18:23.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see that you have some experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.89,0:18:25.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I can't deny that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.85,0:18:30.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}On the other hand, Kanbaru, you look like you know how to handle younger girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.36,0:18:32.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Considering that you're the number one star in school.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.74,0:18:36.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.\NI understand what you're trying to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.41,0:18:39.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Indeed, I am good at dealing with younger girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.87,0:18:42.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I figured.\NI'm glad I asked you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.08,0:18:47.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Since it's your request, I'm not at all reluctant about helping you,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.04,0:18:51.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but this matter also has to do with what we saw yesterday, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.38,0:18:54.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.34,0:18:57.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So... that's how it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.80,0:18:58.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.26,0:19:01.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.99,0:19:17.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sengoku!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.32,0:19:19.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop, Sengoku!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.58,0:19:22.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Koyomi-oniichan?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.75,0:19:32.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Friend.\NI'm Sengoku Nadeko, second grade, class one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.75,0:19:35.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't have very many friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.80,0:19:38.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But Rara-chan plays with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.51,0:19:43.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When Rara-chan invites me to play, my heart feels lifted.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.39,0:19:47.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Also, Rara-chan has a brother in sixth grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.60,0:19:51.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,His name is Koyomi, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.11,0:19:57.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.70,0:20:03.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You changed your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.91,0:20:06.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.\NI got my own room now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.37,0:20:09.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My sisters are still in their old room.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.83,0:20:13.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They'll probably be back in a while, so do you want to see them?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.38,0:20:17.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So this is Araragi-senpai's room!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.47,0:20:21.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's my first time in a guy's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.85,0:20:25.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now then, time to look for some porn magazines.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.35,0:20:28.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.77,0:20:30.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,is an event that only occurs when a guy comes to play in another guy's room!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.27,0:20:32.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just be quiet and sit right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.48,0:20:37.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}However, I believe knowing your taste won't be completely meaningless to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.20,0:20:40.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To me, it'll be more than problematic.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.57,0:20:44.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right, so problematic materials...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.50,0:20:49.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're the personification of a problematic material!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.41,0:20:53.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can sit right there or jump out the window!\NNo other choice, Kanbaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.92,0:21:00.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've already uncovered your {\i1}taste{\i0\fscx150} {\r}when I stalked you in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.93,0:21:06.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know the title of every pornography magazine you bought in the recent past.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.52,0:21:08.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!\NThat's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.48,0:21:11.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No one was in that store when I bought it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.48,0:21:15.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I made sure of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.44,0:21:20.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have quite the maniacal taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.61,0:21:23.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You only have one choice!\NJump out the window!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.70,0:21:29.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you asked for such {\i1}play{\i0}, any ordinary girl would try to run away even if she has to jump out the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.37,0:21:32.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But not to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.37,0:21:34.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's hardly a challenge for a girl of my caliber.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.71,0:21:37.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's proud about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.10,0:21:49.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Koyomi-oniichan...\Nand Kanbaru-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.43,0:21:51.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,may I request that you turn around for a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.65,0:22:00.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm done now.\NPlease turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.25,0:22:11.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bloomers?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.83,0:22:13.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, Araragi-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.17,0:22:17.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I lent her the bloomers that I {\i1}coincidentally{\i0\fscx150} {\r}had.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.38,0:22:19.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.\NJunior Kanbaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.13,0:22:23.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You carry around bloomers by pure chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.72,0:22:25.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's what any lady would do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.43,0:22:28.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, that would apply to perverts.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.43,0:22:33.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can understand that Sengoku doesn't want to show us her underwear,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.48,0:22:35.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but bloomers...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.65,0:22:37.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.40,0:22:43.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looks like rope marks from bondage play.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.91,0:22:47.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are those...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.37,0:22:52.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,scales? From fish?\NNo, in her case, it would be a reptile?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.00,0:22:53.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Snakes?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.66,0:22:55.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Koyomi-oniichan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.79,0:23:03.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Since you're an adult, you won't feel lustful from seeing my body, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.13,0:23:06.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.59,0:23:09.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course I won't.\NRight, Kanbaru?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.89,0:23:12.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't know, Araragi-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.39,0:23:16.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I would think that stating you have absolutely no interest in a lady in the nude
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.31,0:23:18.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,is in fact more of an insult to a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.23,0:23:20.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.90,0:23:25.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll correct myself.\NI do have some dirty thoughts from seeing your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.99,0:23:32.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kanbaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.99,0:23:34.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I did as you said, and I made a junior high girl cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.04,0:23:37.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't think you'd tell her so directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.67,0:23:38.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sengoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.54,0:23:43.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I... I...\NI don't like this body.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.21,0:23:46.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sengoku?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.84,0:23:52.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't!\NHelp me, Koyomi-oniichan.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.94,0:25:27.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Karen!\NI'm Tsukihi!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.28,0:25:29.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey! No matter how you say it, nothing is going to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.24,0:25:30.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing's going to change!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.61,0:25:33.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even so the guy who thought my name was Karen like in "Junjou Karen" matters a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.57,0:25:34.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yup, a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.49,0:25:36.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One spells my name "Karen" but it's not said Karen, it's Kallen!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.99,0:25:38.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not Karen, it's Kallen!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.66,0:25:39.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's not going to come back is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.91,0:25:41.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that what you think, Tsukihi-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.12,0:25:42.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you say it's not walking, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.46,0:25:43.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If so, that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.38,0:25:46.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My name is like the "kuda" in Matsuo Basho's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.59,0:25:47.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.50,0:25:49.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Atsukihi!\NLike the Mogami River, you go to sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.01,0:25:51.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't dump me into the sea like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.30,0:25:53.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know anyone like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.13,0:25:53.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Modern theme quiz!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.05,0:25:54.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Modern theme?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.97,0:25:56.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're in the depression of the century!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.51,0:25:57.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, she's serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.51,0:25:59.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then, you'll hit the jackpot after 99 years!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.68,0:26:00.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What great luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.89,0:26:02.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Next time, Nadeko Snake, part 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.77,0:26:04.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, it could happen in less than a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.56,0:26:06.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or it could also take longer than a hundred years.
